\section*{S. Text v43: the delta check of text v42}
Source: the read-only delta check \fn{writeup/lemmaU/bulk/fix23_delta_check/DELTA_CHECK_v42.md} of text v42 (verdict ``OK with fixes; no blocking finding''). Its Part~A reviewed the S3 theorems \fn{exists_isLagImmersion_of_periodic}, \fn{lift_injective}, \fn{cdf_maximal_shift} and \fn{isFlow_glue_endpoint} (snapshot \fn{writeup/lean_bridge/snap_s3/}) against what C-1 and U-1 need: faithful, not vacuous. Text v43 (\fn{writeup/lemmaU/bulk/fix24_texts_v43/}, built by \fn{tools/build_v43.py} from \fn{fix22_texts_v42/}, which is unchanged) applies its four should-fix items and nine wording items. No number was computed; no certified value changed; no Lean file was built or edited. Parts 1--6 above are verbatim; Part~7 (section R) is verbatim except for the four places marked ``[text v43]'' or ``[Rewritten in text v43]'' (R2, R3(b), R4, R6).
\subsection*{S1. Should-fix items}
S-1 (records): U-1 \S1.2 now names the compile records of the S3 files \fn{Periodic2Circle.lean}, \fn{MaxShift.lean}, \fn{All.lean} (the raw logs \fn{writeup/lean_bridge/raw_Periodic2Circle.log}, \fn{raw_MaxShift.log}, \fn{raw_All.log}), and says that the log of the full \fn{lake build CWFlow.Curve.All} is to be kept (records item L-2). Until that build the status stays ``compiled per file''. S-2: the gaps item ``Lean'' of U-1 no longer says that \fn{All.lean} was never compiled (it was compiled after the S3 additions, as \S1.2 of U-1 says), and its list of compiled theorems includes (PC), (MS), (GE). S-3: R3(b) above said that text v42 states the gluing lemma ``as \fn{rst_glue} (gluing with an overlap)''; that was a leftover of the first draft of text v42, which states it in the endpoint form, proved by \fn{isFlow_glue_endpoint}. R3(b) is rewritten. S-4: \fn{lemmaU_v43.tex} \S``Standing facts'' stated (P1) as ``if the maximal time is finite then $\int\kappa^2ds\to\infty$''; (T1) gives $\sup_{t<T_{\max}}\int\kappa^2ds=\infty$, not a limit. The text now states the sup form, as continuation (P1$'$) and U-1 do; no argument used the limit.
\subsection*{S2. Wording items}
W-1: the status boxes of \fn{step3_v43_main.tex} and \fn{main_v3_v43.tex}, the (P1$'$) item of \fn{continuation_v43.tex}, C-1 (I4) and its label line, the U-1 source line and R4, R6 above now say that review W7 covers the theorems of \fn{snap_final} only and that the S3 theorems were reviewed in the delta check fix23, Part~A; R6 no longer lists an independent check of the S3 theorems as open. W-2: the axiom checks for (T4), (T5) are in \fn{Criterion.lean}. W-3: (MS), last clause, states the range $t\in[0,T_{\max}-t_1)$. W-4: U-1 Lemma ``gluing'' states the existential $\Psi$ of (GE), and the step to the piecewise map is marked [hand]; the identification $T_{\max}=T_*-t_1$ in C-1 Theorem (v) is written out and marked [hand] on top of (MS). W-5: \fn{main_v3_v43.tex} no longer calls (P1) a literature fact in the step-3 caveats. W-6: the 13 November status box of \fn{main_v3_v43.tex} is marked superseded. W-7: the \fn{CWFlow} bibliography entries (continuation, step3\_main), the labels of C-1, \fn{b12_preamble_v43.tex}, the status box of \fn{main_v3_v43.tex} and R2 above name both \fn{writeup/lean_bridge/snap_final/SHA256SUMS} and \fn{writeup/lean_bridge/snap_s3/SHA256SUMS} (the S3 files and the current \fn{All.lean}). W-8: the C-1 row of the order table of \fn{bootstrap_v43.tex} says ``compiled per file, full build and commit pending''. W-9: (PC) names the regular periodic curve $c(\theta)=e^{i\theta}$ that inhabits the hypothesis of (T1); the unused macro \fn{tD} is removed from U-1.
\subsection*{S3. Status (v43)}
Step~3 is \emph{not} closed. Open: a full \fn{lake build CWFlow.Curve.All} and its log; the commit of \fn{CWFlow/Curve/} and its citation; the author items (P3$'$), Lemma~O arc by arc, the single-point statement; the authors' Windows runs of \fn{kit_step3_v4.zip} and \fn{kit_step4b_v4.zip}; LaTeX compilation; the step-4 text patch (\fn{STEP4_PATCH_NOTE_v43.md}, needs the authors' go); a final review. The text-v43 changes have not been checked independently.
